# The Sleet Kilns (CIPlay the_sleet_kilns): the plan The Rainmakers' seventh island, quest "Seeding Salt"
# The kiln yard (3 m) round 0 6 r 28: five kilns at x -20..20 z 2 (Kiln 4's door at 10 -0.7); the smelter house
# x -3..3 z 14..18.5; salt heaps at -22 18, 22 18, -24 -12; the tram stop at 0 -46, the tramway up x 0 to z -18.
island The Sleet Kilns
offset 0 29
expect step 0
expect title Seeding Salt
wait 3
expect hidden ambushzone
zone tram_stop
expect step 1
read Kiln master's log
expect step 2
use scales
expect message three sacks of salt
use saltheap1
use saltheap1
expect message taken a sack
use saltheap2
use saltheap3
expect story saltsack 3
use scales
expect story weighed 1
expect step 3
open Kiln store
expect message locked
open Kiln 4 door
expect story storekey 1
expect step 4
open Kiln store
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_SmelterElectric 1
expect item Blueprint_BiofuelExtractorAdvanced 1
expect item Blueprint_AnchorStationaryAdvanced 1
expect step 8
# RAIN 10-26: the hub, Kalle Strom, the climb, Ash Cave, the secrets
expect hidden sk_rewchest
use sk_machine
expect hidden sk_rewchest
read Kiln hand's notice
expect step 9
use Kalle Strom
wait 1
expect step 10
expect hidden sk_lampchest
use Kiln lamp 2
use Kiln lamp 3
wait 1
expect shown sk_lampchest
open Kalle's tin
zone sk_trail
expect step 11
zone sk_summit
expect step 12
open Salt-drop chimney deck box
wait 3
expect story sk_top 1
expect step 13
zone sk_cave
expect step 14
open Ash Cave chest
wait 3
expect story sk_cave 1
expect step 15
use sk_machine
expect shown sk_rewchest
expect story sk_fixed 1
open Salt crusher reward
wait 3
read Crusher ledger
expect step 16
# the secrets: the plane, the jumps, the maze, the set
zone sk_plane
open Salt plane's crate
read Salt pilot's note
zone sk_jumps
open Ash perch
open Ash top
zone sk_maze
open Kiln hands' box
expect hidden sk_setchest
use sk_piece1
use sk_piece2
use sk_piece3
use sk_piece4
use sk_piece5
wait 2
expect shown sk_setchest
open Salt case
expect shown ambushzone
zone ambush
wait 2
kill Hyena
expect done
